content.text:
请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-09-weather-care-004

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
帮我做个文字盖背景图上的，点一下跳进app读天气，显示已完成

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "帮我做个文字盖背景图上的，点一下跳进app读天气，显示已完成",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "",
        "abilityName": "",
        "uri": "hww://www.huawei.com/totemweather?enterType=share&cityCode="
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "data": {
      "weather": {
        "location": {
          "districtName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "天气查询地区名称，未指定时表示当前位置。",
            "sampleValue": "当前位置"
          }
        },
        "current": {
          "temperatureText": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前温度展示文本。",
            "sampleValue": "26°C"
          },
          "condition": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前天气现象。",
            "sampleValue": "多云"
          },
          "airQuality": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前空气质量等级。",
            "sampleValue": "良"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "state": {
      "completionText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "卡片任务完成状态展示文本。",
        "sampleValue": "已完成"
      },
      "loading": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "天气数据加载状态。",
        "sampleValue": false
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/partly_cloudy.png",
      "description": "云朵在前、太阳在后的彩色天气图标，可作为天气卡片背景视觉层或主天气识别图形。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","catalogId":"ohos.a2ui.extended.catalog","width":140,"height":140}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","root":"root","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Stack","children":["weather_bg","content_column"],"onClick":[{"call":"clickToDeeplink","args":{"bundleName":"","abilityName":"","uri":"hww://www.huawei.com/totemweather?enterType=share&cityCode="}}],"styles":{"width":140,"height":140,"padding":12,"borderRadius":18,"clip":true,"linearGradient":{"direction":"RightBottom","colors":[["#46b1e3",0],["#86c5e3",1]]},"alignContent":"center"}},{"id":"weather_bg","component":"Image","src":"resources/base/media/partly_cloudy.png","styles":{"width":76,"height":76,"objectFit":"contain"}},{"id":"content_column","component":"Column","children":["weather_group","status_text"],"itemMargin":8,"styles":{"width":116,"height":116,"justifyContent":"spaceBetween","alignItems":"start"}},{"id":"weather_group","component":"Column","children":["title_text","primary_value","primary_caption"],"itemMargin":4,"styles":{"width":116,"height":80,"justifyContent":"start","alignItems":"start"}},{"id":"title_text","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/data/weather/location/districtName} + '天气' }}","styles":{"width":116,"height":20,"fontSize":16,"fontWeight":700,"fontColor":"#ffffffff","maxLines":1}},{"id":"primary_value","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/data/weather/current/temperatureText} }}","styles":{"width":116,"height":36,"fontSize":32,"fontWeight":700,"fontColor":"#ffffffff","maxLines":1}},{"id":"primary_caption","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/data/weather/current/condition} + ' · 空气' + ${/data/weather/current/airQuality} }}","styles":{"width":116,"height":16,"fontSize":12,"fontWeight":500,"fontColor":"#e5ffffff","maxLines":1}},{"id":"status_text","component":"Text","content":"{{ ${/state/completionText} }}","styles":{"width":56,"height":24,"padding":{"left":8,"right":8},"borderRadius":12,"backgroundColor":"#33ffffff","fontSize":12,"fontWeight":600,"fontColor":"#ffffffff","maxLines":1,"textAlign":"center"}}]}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateDataModel":{"surfaceId":"surface_card","path":"/","value":{"data":{"weather":{"location":{"districtName":"当前位置"},"current":{"temperatureText":"26°C","condition":"多云","airQuality":"良"}}},"state":{"completionText":"已完成","loading":false}}}}

=== 渲染截图 ===
⚠️ 本评分以随附的 card.dsl.png 渲染截图为唯一且最终的依据。请务必先认真看图，根据图中实际呈现的效果打分；上面的 DSL 与 system 中的布局公式仅用于协议合规性检查与改进版 DSL 的撰写，绝不能仅凭 DSL 文本/数值给分。排版与美观问题以截图为准。

输出要求：严格按 system 中规定的 JSON schema 输出单个 JSON 对象，reasons 必须基于截图描述具体视觉现象，improved_dsl 为 3 行合法 JSONL。
